"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/seasons/fdcb7103-5b27-4386-b8a4-1ea5a7ffc2c1.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/seasons/78b7e72d-4ec5-485c-83d5-68666cc37523.png","likes":133,"dislikes":6,"views":34544,"release_date":"1393632000000","season_number":1,"description":"A madly intense whirlwind drama about love, betrayal, friendship, and hope. Kurt Seyit, a soldier in the Tsar's army from Turkish descent, falls in love with Alexandra (Sura), a beautiful Russian nobleman's daughter. The perils of WW1, old traditions, and betrayal wreak havoc on these young lover's will to stay together and persevere. They eventually find themselves living in limbo amongst new friends and family at a hotel in Istanbul. From there their love is tossed around amongst these new friends only to find their lives completely changed by what they left behind. Can they love and live despite their past and in spite of their future?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":9782,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}